{"id":"vod_bf_17848","vodId":"17848","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"绝园的暴风雨","name_cn":"绝园的暴风雨","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-19/d3b51435d30fecc0b90933f14f0b5d6c.jpg"},"summary":"魔法使一族的野心使他们为了获取更强的力量，促使他们唤醒了不该唤醒的东西，世界的毁灭近在眼前。只有最强的魔法使公主锁部叶风（泽城美雪 配音）才能阻止这一切的发生，但被部下锁部左门（小山力也 配音）暗算的叶风被困在了施了结界的无人岛上。高中二年级学生泷川吉野（内山昂辉 配音）的好友不破真广（丰永利行 配音）的妹妹不破爱花（花泽香菜 配音）被入室抢劫犯所杀，但是真广却认为妹妹的死疑点重重。为了调查妹妹的死因，真广通过海上的漂流人偶和锁部叶风达成秘密交易。　　真广在失踪一个月后，在大雪的冬日伴随着漫天的蝴蝶突然从天而降。与此同时，可怕的“黑铁病”在整个日本蔓延开来。真广到底和魔法使公主结下了什么样的契约，而他到底带着怎样的使命来到这个世界？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:12:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueyuandebaofengyu